title: "Follow the Data: Catching Split Attacks in Agent Swarms with Decision Model Graphs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Redfern
    given-names: Thomas
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-1698-4082"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tms7331/apart-research-sprint-swarmgraph"
